# Route: guide 50 of 50 of the simulator's completionist route for Skyborne
# (1539 of 1546 eligible quests, 166.6 h, world baeac23fbe5e): levels 60 to
# 60, 47 quests, 8.6 h under the model. The order is the simulator's (`sim run
# --objective completionist`, then `sim export`; docs/SIMULATION.md §10): fix
# a step in the exporter or the data, not only here, so the next export keeps
# it.
#
# Flow (Duskwood, Stormwind City, Azshara, Wetlands, Arathi Highlands,
# Westfall, Hillsbrad Foothills, Moonglade, Durotar, Stranglethorn Vale): The
# Hushed Bank -> Darkshire -> Manor Mistmantle -> Darkshire -> Raven Hill
# Cemetery -> near Stormwind City -> Stormwind City -> Ravencrest Monument ->
# Dun Modr -> Refuge Pointe -> Sentinel Hill -> Westfall Lighthouse ->
# Sentinel Hill -> ….
#
# Optional (elite: grouping up is advised): Morbent Fel (55; Morbent Fel 32);
# Crushridge Warmongers (504; Crushridge Warmonger 39-40).
#
# Left to other guides: class quests (the Class category); dungeon quests (the
# Dungeons guides): Crime and Punishment (377), Crime and Punishment (377),
# Quell The Uprising (387), Quell the Uprising (387), The Color of Blood
# (388), The Color of Blood (388), The Stockade Riots (391), The Stockade
# Riots (391), Underground Assault (2040), Underground Assault (2040), Bring
# the Light (3636), A Green Sample (92456), A Green Sample (92456), Power
# Overwhelming (92489), Power Overwhelming (92489), The Fury Runs Deep (378),
# The Fury Runs Deep (378), Lost in the Thicket Things (95647), Fallen in the
# Fen (95795), Heartwoven (95809), Highland Hides (98815), Highland Hides
# (98815), Prehistoric Prism (98824), Prehistoric Prism (98824), The Defias
# Brotherhood (166), The Defias Brotherhood (166), The Unsent Letter (373), In
# the Name of the Light (1053).

